d it will replace batteries in affected units at no charge. The company posted a page on its website where customers can check if their laptop is affected and begin the battery exchange process. The issue doesn't affect models with the Touch Bar.Copyright RTT News/dpa-AFX", "external_links": [], "published": "2018-04-21T05:31:00.000+03:00", "crawled": "2018-04-21T05:38:11.048+03:00", "highlightTitle": ""}